OL,3,GNEWSAPassenger criticises response to
OL,4,Atrain derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger on a train which derailed
OL,7,Fnear Lewes in East Sussex has
OL,8,Fcriticised the rail industry's
OL,9,Fresponse, both immediately afterwards,
OL,10,Fand in the weeks since the incident
OL,11,Fwhich injured 22 people.
OL,13,FRob Bradley and his six-year-old
OL,14,Fdaughter were among about 150
OL,15,Fpassengers on the service which
OL,16,Fderailed on 13 August, leaving two
OL,17,Fpeople with serious injuries.
OL,19,FBradley has also joined a group of
OL,20,Fpeople who are taking legal action
OL,21,Fagainst Southern Rail over their
OL,22,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
