OL,3,GNEWSAPassenger criticises response to
OL,4,Atrain derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for both companies said
OL,7,F"a wealth of support has been offered
OL,8,Fto those we know were onboard the
OL,9,Ftrain" since the derailment.
